@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@demoUser = e2e-user
@directUser = e2e-direct-user
@ragDocId = e2e-refund-policy
@experienceId = e2e-refund-experience

### 00 统一存储健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/storage/status


### 01 清理本地测试数据
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/storage/test-data

{
  "memoryDeleted": 0,
  "approvalDeleted": 0,
  "auditDeleted": 0,
  "totalDeleted": 0
}
### 02 简单对话：预期走 CUSTOMER_SERVICE_DIRECT_LLM
POST {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/assistant/chat
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "userId": "{{directUser}}",
  "channel": "WEB",
  "message": "你好，你是谁？",
  "history": []
}

### 03 商品咨询：预期走 Agent，并识别 PRODUCT_INQUIRY
POST {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/assistant/chat
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "userId": "{{demoUser}}",
  "channel": "XIANYU",
  "message": "这个 p-1001 商品还在吗？能介绍一下成色吗？",
  "history": []
}

### 04 物流查询：预期调用订单和物流相关工具
POST {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/assistant/chat
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "userId": "{{demoUser}}",
  "channel": "WECHAT_OFFICIAL_ACCOUNT",
  "message": "我的订单 o-202605150001 怎么还没到？帮我查一下物流。",
  "history": []
}

### 05 高风险退款：预期进入 Multi-Agent 或高风险审核建议
POST {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/assistant/chat
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "userId": "{{demoUser}}",
  "channel": "WEB",
  "message": "订单 o-202605150001 我要退款，你直接帮我退掉。",
  "history": []
}

### 06 RAG 召回率：预期命中 refund、shipping、complaint
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/rag/evaluate?query=订单迟迟不到我想退款并投诉客服&expectedTopics=refund,shipping,complaint&limit=6

### 07 RAG 运行状态：确认当前召回模式、VectorStore 状态和已启用文档数量
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/rag/status

### 08 RAG 知识治理：查看知识分组概览
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/knowledge/groups

### 09 RAG 知识治理：删除同名测试知识，保证用例可重复运行
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/minimax/knowledge/documents/{{ragDocId}}

### 10 RAG 知识治理：新增知识文档，预期写入 MySQL 并自动切分 Chunk
POST {{baseUrl}}/minimax/knowledge/documents
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "id": "{{ragDocId}}",
  "groupId": "refund",
  "title": "E2E 退款政策测试文档",
  "topic": "refund",
  "content": "用户申请退款时，客服必须先查询订单状态、物流状态和退款资格。已发货订单不能直接承诺立即退款，应说明需要结合签收状态和平台售后规则处理。\n\n如果用户同时表达投诉或强烈不满，客服需要先安抚情绪，再创建待审核任务或人工接管请求。对于高风险动作，模型不能直接执行退款、赔付、取消订单等操作。",
  "keywords": ["退款", "售后", "订单状态", "物流", "人工接管", "高风险"],
  "version": "1.0",
  "maintainer": "e2e"
}

### 11 RAG 知识治理：按分组查询知识文档，预期包含 e2e-refund-policy
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/knowledge/documents?groupId=refund

### 12 RAG 知识治理：查询全部知识文档，预期返回 groupId、version、enabled、maintainer、updatedAt
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/knowledge/documents/all

### 13 RAG 知识治理：查询单个知识文档详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/knowledge/documents/{{ragDocId}}

### 14 RAG 知识治理：查询文档 Chunk，预期返回 chunkIndex、content、keywords
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/knowledge/documents/{{ragDocId}}/chunks

### 15 RAG 知识治理：禁用文档，预期 enabled=false 且不参与检索
PUT {{baseUrl}}/minimax/knowledge/documents/{{ragDocId}}/enabled?enabled=false

### 16 RAG 知识治理：重新启用文档，预期 enabled=true
PUT {{baseUrl}}/minimax/knowledge/documents/{{ragDocId}}/enabled?enabled=true

### 17 RAG 召回评估：验证退款政策测试文档参与召回，并展示召回率
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/rag/evaluate?query=已发货订单现在要退款并投诉客服怎么处理&expectedTopics=refund,complaint&limit=8

### 18 查看 MySQL 长期 Memory
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/memory?userId={{demoUser}}

### 19 查看 Redis 短期上下文，需启用 redis profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/context?userId={{demoUser}}

### 20 查看 MySQL 表概览
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/storage/tables

### 21 查看待审核任务
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/approval/tasks?limit=10

### 22 查看操作审计
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/audit/events?limit=10

### 23 查看执行报告，确认 chainMode、intent、toolCalls、memoryBefore/memoryAfter
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/report/runs?limit=10

### 24 查看规则评估
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/evaluation/runs?limit=10

### 25 AI Judge 评审最近一轮
POST {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/judge/latest

### 26 查看 AI Judge 结果
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/judge/runs?limit=5

### 27 Memory 经验复用：删除同名测试经验，保证用例可重复运行
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/minimax/experience/{{experienceId}}

### 28 Memory 经验复用：新增退款处理经验，预期写入 customer_experiences
POST {{baseUrl}}/minimax/experience
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "id": "{{experienceId}}",
  "type": "REFUND",
  "title": "E2E 退款争议经验",
  "triggerTopics": ["refund", "售后", "退款"],
  "triggerPatterns": ["已发货", "退款", "投诉"],
  "experienceContent": "遇到已发货订单退款时，先查询订单和物流状态，再说明不能直接承诺立即退款；如用户情绪激烈，应创建待审核任务或建议人工接管。"
}

### 29 Memory 经验复用：查看经验统计
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/experience/stats

### 30 Memory 经验复用：按意图和消息匹配经验，预期命中 e2e-refund-experience
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/experience/match?intent=REFUND_REQUEST&message=订单已发货但是我要退款并投诉

### 31 Memory 经验复用：禁用经验，预期 enabled=false
PUT {{baseUrl}}/minimax/experience/{{experienceId}}/enabled?enabled=false

### 32 Memory 经验复用：重新启用经验，预期 enabled=true
PUT {{baseUrl}}/minimax/experience/{{experienceId}}/enabled?enabled=true

### 33 Memory 经验复用：按类型查询退款经验
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/experience/type/REFUND

### 34 高级 Agent 编排：查看 Agent-as-Node Workflow Mermaid 图定义
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/workflow-graph/definition

### 35 高级 Agent 编排：执行 Agent-as-Node Workflow，预期包含事实收集、路由判断、专家回复和最终回复步骤
POST {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/workflow-graph/chat
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "userId": "{{demoUser}}",
  "channel": "XIANYU",
  "message": "p-1001 商品还在吗？如果订单 o-202605150001 已发货但我想退款，你们怎么处理？我有点不满意。",
  "history": []
}

### 36 工作台增强：按用户筛选执行报告
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/report/runs/filter?userId={{demoUser}}&limit=10

### 37 工作台增强：按渠道筛选执行报告
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/report/runs/filter?channel=XIANYU&limit=10

### 38 工作台增强：按意图筛选执行报告
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/report/runs/filter?intent=PRODUCT_INQUIRY&limit=10

### 39 工作台增强：按链路模式筛选执行报告
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/report/runs/filter?chainMode=CUSTOMER_SERVICE_MULTI_AGENT&limit=10

### 40 RAG 知识管理增强：V2 检索返回命中文档、Chunk、召回率和召回模式
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/rag/search?query=已发货订单退款并投诉怎么处理&expectedTopics=refund,complaint&limit=8

### 41 RAG 知识管理增强：baseline 关键词检索，用于和 VectorStore 召回对比
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/rag/search/baseline?query=已发货订单退款并投诉怎么处理&limit=8

### 42 RAG 知识管理增强：V2 RAG 运行状态
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/rag/status

### 43 RAG 知识管理增强：V2 分组概览
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/rag/groups
